<title>USA: First Israel Fund Inc sets distribution.</title>
<headline>First Israel Fund Inc sets distribution.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Israel Fund Inc said it declared a distribution of $1.035 per share.</p>
<p>The distribution is represented by net short-term capital gains of $0.055 per share and net long-term capital gains of $0.98 per share.</p>
<p>The distribution is payable June 20 to shareholders of record on June 6.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid was $0.20 per share of net long-term capital gains.</p>
</text>
